# Paths the template manages that this repo keeps its own version of.
# One path per line, each with a comment saying why.

# The template's LICENSE is MIT. Lineup is a private studiobimo product, so it is all
# rights reserved until a decision to open it (the licence issue in milestone M5).
LICENSE

# Lineup deploys with cf:deploy or Workers Builds, so no Cloudflare credential is kept in
# GitHub (docs/adr/0001-single-worker.md).
.github/workflows/deploy.yml

# Lineup's pull requests go to develop (ADR-0019), so its Dependabot entries name it as
# target-branch. The template's entries open them against main.
.github/dependabot.yml

# jscpd would flag the generated API reference, a file this repo commits (apps/web/public/api-docs);
# the template's list does not know it.
.jscpd.json
